            "notes": "Standard kit to maximize incendiary rounds. Your goal should be to proc that as much as you can on their supports early on and put pressure on any pushes that come in. Plink at Genji's and Reapers before they dive in to discourage them. You should be playing at off angles about mid distance from the fight. \n\nI take the  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) 9 times out of 10 to just give me a little insurance on surviving encounters. \n\nPro tip: Use your reloads to rotate positions or juke them into thinking you're repositioning.\n\nIf you end up with a Brig or Zen as allies, post up near health packs.",
