            "created_at": "2025-08-29T16:35:58.624179+00:00",
            "notes": "[Early Detonation](item_9e8a8aad-96a1-4068-994c-be0d3750469b)  is a great skill if you're still going for Weapon Damage since it helps you keep additional pressure with Dynamites while giving you more ammo to work with so you can keep proccing  [Incendiary Rounds](item_0cff5b79-dd12-475a-aca1-24fd4e8b8491). \n\nIf you feel like you can get value here with Ability Power feel free to drop the [Maxed Mag](item_e73221bc-1197-4034-b122-fe3feb2d2292)  and  [Greased Loader](item_0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead) though I personally like to hold onto the  [Maxed Mag](item_e73221bc-1197-4034-b122-fe3feb2d2292)  well into round 4 or 5 as the Attack Speed buff is so good.\n\nIf things aren't going so hot this is the round to commit to a different build or add some more survivability. [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09)  or  [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214)  go a long way. Honorable mention to  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) if you are in an awkward place with stadium cash or want more bang for buck items.\n\nI sometimes also go with [B.O.B Jr.](item_a0599423-2cd6-4779-81c1-fb933fbad07d) if we need to really mix it up and the team comp feels stale. This is typically due to a weak tank or an enemy comp who has a well positioned backline that needs disruption. I feel this is a solid choice against an Ana/Zen/Mercy as it restricts their LoS and punishes their Tank and DPS if they move up too aggressively.",
