            "notes": "This is the round I like to switch it up to keep the enemy team guessing and catch them off guard. Rarely does the Weapon damage variant of Ashe usually make it this far but if it's a close game, Ability Power from this point on tends to finish the series as it has a higher AoE proc for  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505)  and  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98).\n\n[Incendiary Rounds](item_0cff5b79-dd12-475a-aca1-24fd4e8b8491) from round 1 is still potent enough to finish enemies off or get them damaged enough to get ticked away by Dynamite or force repositions.\n\nUse Bob to split teams in half or force the supports to take risky/vulnerable positions to support their tanks. You should be able to throw 3-5 Bobs in a match. Bait out cooldowns that can melt him and send him in to cause chaos.",
