            "notes": "Flex time depending on what your team needs. Usually at this point you're snowballing and have massive crowd control or you're neck and neck and need to clutch some plays. \n\nAll I can say is that that dynamite should be on cool down as much as possible and your main goal is to clean up the supports and continue to separate the teams with your Bob. \n\nDon't be afraid to Bob early as you should be an ult farming machine by now.\n\nIf you're dripping in stadium cash grab [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). I honestly think [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is underrated for the value you get as well.",
